  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p>제가 영상을 만드는 이유 중 하나는</p><p>수업내용과 관련하여 제 머릿속에서 그려지는 이미지를 최대한 그대로 학생들에게 전달하기 위함입니다.</p><p>그 부분 중에 하나가 4.변성암 부분에 담겨있는데요, 열과 압력을 받을 때 조직이 커지는 이유입니다.</p><p>속성작용 같은 경우에는 중학교 수준에서 다루지 않는 내용이지만, 개념의 정리를 위해 도입하였구요,</p><p>화강편마암은 다루는 책도 있고 아닌 책도 있지만 화성암이 변성작용을 받을 때의 예시를 보여주기 위해 일부러 추가하였습니다.</p><p><br></p><p><iframe width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TZx7mEDNEiw?list=PLpps1Hm_DCYHN6-uG1z0NZ-CvEZkKinSp\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p><br></p><p><iframe width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_HmSFEEH_3k?list=PLpps1Hm_DCYHN6-uG1z0NZ-CvEZkKinSp\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p><br></p><p><iframe width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/r2EH3rzLV5Y?list=PLpps1Hm_DCYHN6-uG1z0NZ-CvEZkKinSp\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p><br></p><p><iframe width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kudmiknA3NI?list=PLpps1Hm_DCYHN6-uG1z0NZ-CvEZkKinSp\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/992EFA435E5E278E2A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"슬라이드1.jpg\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_992EFA435E5E278E2A0213\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99CA51435E5E278F25\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"슬라이드2.jpg\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_99CA51435E5E278F251817\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99E115435E5E278F35\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"슬라이드3.jpg\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_99E115435E5E278F358379\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9918CC435E5E278F2B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"슬라이드4.jpg\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_9918CC435E5E278F2B7F4F\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9909D6435E5E279034\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"슬라이드1.jpg\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_9909D6435E5E279034300E\"/></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/992A3F4D5E5E285404\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"Ⅰ.02-03. 암석(형성평가)001.jpg\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_992A3F4D5E5E2854042F10\"/></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3Del1w%26dataid%3D31%26fileid%3D6%26regdt%3D20200303184454&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile300.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F99171C4A5E5E27CC048057')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> Ⅰ.02-01. 암석(활동지).pdf</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3Del1w%26dataid%3D31%26fileid%3D7%26regdt%3D20200303184454&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile274.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F9996584A5E5E27CC2C9D3E')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> Ⅰ.02-03. 암석(형성평가).pdf</a></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
